Slint Royalty-free License 2.0, as in the other MoneyKeep family apps. As that
licence requires, ShareKeep shows Slint's "About Slint" in Settings > About.
ShareKeep does not redistribute Slint on its own and does not expose Slint's APIs
to scripts or plugins. ShareKeep's own code stays MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Every third-party crate compiled into the programs is listed with its version,
its licence and the licence texts it ships in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt, installed
beside the programs.
